        "content": "//sets value to 1 if there's at least one instance of email with value\\nvar domainLen = PN_RepeatDomain.instanceManager.instances.length;\\nvar domainVal = \\"\\";\\n\\nfor(i=0; i<domainLen; i++){\\n  if(PN_RepeatDomain.instanceManager.instances[i].PN_RepeatDomainContent.domain2.value){\\n    domainVal = \\"1\\";\\n    break;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\ndomainVal;"\,
